# TDD

Follow `.cursor/skills/tdd` on every implementation slice.

- Write a **failing test first** from the slice **Given / When / Then**. Then only enough code to go green.
- Seams come from the PRD/slice, not from asking a human.
- Prefer golden-file tests for HTML / Markdown / JSON writers. Expected values are independent of the code under test.
- Validate new or changed OSCAL against the vendored NIST **1.1.2** schemas (`enact validate` / `enact.validate`).
- **Do not refactor in the red → green loop.** Refactoring belongs to `.cursor/skills/code-review`.
